{
  "id": "revive",
  "title": "如何从科学角度上复活一个人？",
  "resolution": "720x1280",
  "characters": {
    "A": {
      "name": "企鵝燈",
      "role": "questioner",
      "color": "#FFD54F"
    },
    "B": {
      "name": "熊大",
      "role": "explainer",
      "color": "#81C784"
    }
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "熊大我昨晚做梦梦到老大和胖猫了",
      "start": 0.12,
      "end": 3.88,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0001_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "我就在想",
      "start": 3.88,
      "end": 5.1,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0002_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "如果不借助魔法或者灵能",
      "start": 5.1,
      "end": 7.54,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0003_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "单纯靠科学",
      "start": 7.54,
      "end": 9.09,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0004_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "我们能够复活他们吗",
      "start": 9.09,
      "end": 11.07,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0005_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "只要满足一个核心条件",
      "start": 11.07,
      "end": 12.91,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0006_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "理论上是可行的",
      "start": 12.91,
      "end": 14.489,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0007_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "复活的本质从信息论的角度来看",
      "start": 14.489,
      "end": 17.209,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0008_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "是信息的保存",
      "start": 17.209,
      "end": 18.63,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0009_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "也就是在死亡的那一刻",
      "start": 18.63,
      "end": 20.39,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0010_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "将对象身体与意识的所有信息收录和保存下来",
      "start": 20.39,
      "end": 24.45,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0011_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "通过对意识的备份",
      "start": 24.45,
      "end": 25.91,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0012_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "来确保人死亡后还能再次复活",
      "start": 25.91,
      "end": 28.51,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0013_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "也就是说",
      "start": 28.51,
      "end": 29.63,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0014_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "只要把我的信息都存下来",
      "start": 29.63,
      "end": 31.85,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0015_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "我就能无限复活了",
      "start": 31.85,
      "end": 33.83,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0016_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那这需要多大的信息量",
      "start": 33.83,
      "end": 35.95,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0017_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "这取决于你对复活的精度要求",
      "start": 35.95,
      "end": 38.28,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0018_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "如果只是扫描所有的860亿个神经元",
      "start": 38.28,
      "end": 41.1,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0019_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "和100万亿个突触的连接方式",
      "start": 41.1,
      "end": 43.2,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0020_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "也就是你的大脑结构",
      "start": 43.2,
      "end": 44.78,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0021_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "数据量大概是1PB1PB",
      "start": 44.78,
      "end": 47.53,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0022_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "这有多大",
      "start": 47.53,
      "end": 48.87,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0023_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "1PB大概能存100亿本书",
      "start": 48.87,
      "end": 51.27,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0024_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "如果意识只是结构",
      "start": 51.27,
      "end": 52.79,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0025_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那这够了",
      "start": 52.79,
      "end": 53.81,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0026_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "但这只能延续你的记忆和人格",
      "start": 53.81,
      "end": 56.11,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0027_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "却无法延续你死前那一刻的情绪和思想",
      "start": 56.11,
      "end": 59.13,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0028_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "因为那些转瞬即逝的意识活动",
      "start": 59.13,
      "end": 61.35,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0029_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "可能依赖于神经递质的实时浓度",
      "start": 61.35,
      "end": 63.63,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0030_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "离子通道的开关状态",
      "start": 63.63,
      "end": 65.319,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0031_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "甚至是蛋白质的折叠方式",
      "start": 65.319,
      "end": 67.179,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0032_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "也就是说只存结构的话",
      "start": 67.179,
      "end": 69.68,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0033_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "复活回来的那个",
      "start": 69.68,
      "end": 71.0,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0034_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "我可能不记得死前正在构思的那句话",
      "start": 71.0,
      "end": 74.3,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0035_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "或者丢掉了当时的情绪",
      "start": 74.3,
      "end": 76.73,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0036_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那如果我想连死前那一刻的情绪都完美复活呢",
      "start": 76.73,
      "end": 80.77,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0037_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "想要做到完美复活",
      "start": 80.77,
      "end": 82.19,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0038_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "我们需要扫描到原子级别",
      "start": 82.19,
      "end": 84.17,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0039_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "扫描每个神经元内部蛋白质的折叠状态",
      "start": 84.17,
      "end": 87.05,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0040_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "神经递质分子的精确位置",
      "start": 87.05,
      "end": 89.12,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0041_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "这个数据量会暴增到1YB",
      "start": 89.12,
      "end": 91.24,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0042_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "也就是一爻字节等等",
      "start": 91.24,
      "end": 93.32,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0043_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "啥是一阳之极",
      "start": 93.32,
      "end": 94.7,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0044_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "1024兆等于1G1024G等于1T",
      "start": 94.7,
      "end": 98.24,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0045_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "1024T等于1P1024",
      "start": 98.24,
      "end": 100.64,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0046_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "P等于111024",
      "start": 100.64,
      "end": 102.19,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0047_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "E等于EZ",
      "start": 102.19,
      "end": 103.09,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0048_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "1024",
      "start": 103.09,
      "end": 103.83,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0049_A.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Z等于1YEYB",
      "start": 103.83,
      "end": 105.74,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0050_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "相当于全人类历史上所有书籍文献",
      "start": 105.74,
      "end": 108.78,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0051_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "文字记录总和的100万亿倍",
      "start": 108.78,
      "end": 110.93,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0052_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "只有到了这个精度",
      "start": 110.93,
      "end": 112.29,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0053_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "才能确保复活后的你不仅记得我是谁",
      "start": 112.29,
      "end": 115.27,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0054_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "还能保持着死亡前那一刻的惊恐或平静",
      "start": 115.27,
      "end": 118.15,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0055_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "既然原理这么清晰",
      "start": 118.15,
      "end": 119.97,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0056_B.mp3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "读取存储写入",
      "start": 119.97,
      "end": 120.0,
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_revive_line0057_A.mp3"
    }
  ]
}